      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you are not aware we are waiting for the websocket system that is used with various in game notifications and I think the website to be implemented for the social menu. So no manual refresh but rather a system that actually updates correctly.\n\nI think while it has been worked on and bugs have and are being fixed on the notifications side in game, we may not actually see the social menu get updated until after udon at this point. I'm also waiting for what is supposed to be an amazing update to network IK but I am not expecting that until next year at the rate things are going with unity 2018 and udon.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
