      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "my social menu never updates, and even if i have them in a favorite group those update slowly. i just use the site if i see some one that i want to join i close the client and use the site to join, if there in a private i use it as an opportunity to clear the memory leak that has inevitably built up.",
